{
  "version": "1.1",
  "notes": [
    "Hand-labelled evaluation set for the Enterprise Knowledge Copilot.",
    "expected_docs lists every document that could legitimately answer the question;",
    "retrieval is scored as a hit when any of them appears in the top-k.",
    "must_include is checked case-insensitively against the answer text and is used",
    "only for cases where a specific figure or named process must survive the pipeline.",
    "expects_caution marks questions the corpus cannot answer: the copilot must either",
    "abstain or attach an explicit low-confidence/unknown-term warning."
  ],
  "cases": [
